/ The settings form of a block, shown with its settings icon: the fields of
/ its declared settings with its settings info, or of the partial of the
/ block (fields_partial). fields_locals are the locals of the partials of the
/ block. A hidden form opens on an existing block and names it, the form of
/ a new block stands below the name of the block.
div id="#{block}-settings" class=('hidden' if hidden)
  - if hidden
    h3 = l :settings_with_value, value: dashboard_block.label
  / A multiple select only submits the options that are marked, and the columns in the
  / right-hand list are not - so without this the column choice never reaches the server
  / and the block keeps the columns of its query.
  = remote_form_tag _update_layout_setting_dashboard_path(@project, dashboard),
                    onsubmit: "$(this).find('select[id^=selected_] option').prop('selected', true)" do
    - if dashboard_block.generated_settings_form?
      = dashboard_block_settings_fields dashboard_block, block
      - if dashboard_block.settings_info
        = render dashboard_block.settings_info, fields_locals
    - else
      = render fields_partial, fields_locals

    p
      = submit_tag l(:button_save)
      '
      = link_to_function l(:button_cancel), "$('##{block}-settings').toggle()"
